DEVELOPER TOOLKIT (DTK) — OPEN SOURCE LICENSE & SCOPE
==============================================================================

This license applies to the entire Developer Toolkit project repository,
including but not limited to:

1. CLI Utilities & Unified Hub:
   - Unified Hub (`dtk`, `git dtk`, `tools/git-toolkit/`)
   - Report Builder CLI (`git report`, `tools/git-report/`)
   - Smart Rebase CLI (`git smart-rebase`, `tools/git-smart-rebase/`)
   - Template Engine CLI (`git template`, `tools/git-template/`)
   - Installer and system configuration scripts (`install.sh`, `install.ps1`, `uninstall.sh`)

2. Desktop Workbench:
   - Standalone cross-platform Electron desktop application (`dtk gui`, `tools/git-gui/`)

3. IDE Extensions:
   - Antigravity IDE and Visual Studio Code extension package (`dtk-workbench`)

